flowchart TD
  A[User opens Stage / Diff / Patch with an object filter] --> B[ZCL_ABAPGIT_STAGE_LOGIC / ZCL_ABAPGIT_GUI_PAGE_DIFF_BASE.get_files_and_status]
  B --> C{Object filter present?}
  C -->|No| D[Full ii_repo_online->get_files_remote]
  C -->|Yes| N{"lv_use_ortec = ZCL_ABAPGIT_ORTEC_GIT_SWITCH=>IS_ACTIVE_FOR_REPO(url)"}

  N -->|"CATCH cx_root -> false"| D
  N -->|"false (default: no ZAOG user-config row for this repo/user)"| D
  N -->|true, explicit opt-in via Repo Settings| E[CALL METHOD ZCL_ABAPGIT_ORTEC_FILTER_WALK=>GET_REMOTE_FILES_FOR_STAGE / DIFF]

  E --> F2["Inner guard (added in same commit e61fcb11): IS_ACTIVE_FOR_REPO(url) = false? -> return get_files_remote immediately"]
  F2 -->|redundant re-check, already true here| F[Resolve repo_key via SHA1 hash of URL against ZAOG_REPO_STATE]
  F --> G{repo_key found?}
  G -->|No| D
  G -->|Yes| H[Read ZAOG_REPO_STATE fetch_commit for selected branch]
  H --> I{fetch_commit cached AND branch tip still matches remote HEAD}
  I -->|No / stale| D
  I -->|Yes| J[ZCL_ABAPGIT_ORTEC_OBJ_INDEX.get_files_for_filter sparse lookup]
  J --> K[Return small filtered remote file set]

  D --> L[zcl_abapgit_repo_status=>calculate over full remote+local sets]
  K --> L
  L --> M[Render Stage / Diff / Patch page]

